{
  "id": "8kfWs8K3sHayhAkH",
  "name": "AI agent that tells you which clients still owe materials",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI agent that tells you which clients still owe materials\n\n**Who it's for:** anyone who wants to ask in chat \"who still owes me\nstuff?\" instead of opening the BriefGate dashboard and checking each\nintake by hand.\n\n**What it does:** an AI Agent with two BriefGate tools \u2014 one to list\nin-progress intakes, one to check a specific intake's status \u2014 answers\nquestions about outstanding client materials in a chat.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Add a **BriefGate API** credential to both BriefGate Tool nodes\n   (`intakes:read` scope is enough).\n2. Add your **OpenAI** credential to the OpenAI Chat Model node (or\n   swap it for another chat model node \u2014 any works with AI Agent).\n3. Open the chat panel (bottom of the canvas) and ask something like\n   \"which clients still owe me materials?\"",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -340,
        -340
      ],
      "id": "c7176303-0604-4864-9a9b-65a06d1d736e",
      "name": "Setup"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -340,
        200
      ],
      "id": "286982b9-d95e-438a-b35b-1844278da7ce",
      "name": "When chat message received",
      "webhookId": "278f5cd5-c037-4933-aeb5-4666cc6d3b05"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You help an agency owner track BriefGate client intakes.\n\nUse the \"List Intakes\" tool to see intakes that are in progress or sent,\nthen use \"Get Intake Status\" on each one you need more detail on to see\nwhich specific items are still pending or needing revision.\n\nAnswer with a short list of clients and exactly what they still owe \u2014\ndon't just say an intake is incomplete, name the missing items."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "id": "fee5deca-051d-4142-b36b-e4011b9b8472",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4.1-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        -120,
        460
      ],
      "id": "d62271b6-fc2a-4a98-9563-e505a97e5d4e",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "name": "OpenAi account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 20,
        "filters": {
          "status": "in_progress"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-briefgate.briefGateTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        460
      ],
      "id": "799937b7-215d-401e-964e-3aa35e721777",
      "name": "List Intakes",
      "credentials": {
